# The transcribed ESV Chronological Bible reading plan — build input, kept out
# of a PUBLIC repo deliberately. The Bible text is public domain; Crossway's
# arrangement of it into 365 chronological readings is their editorial work,
# and a complete machine-readable copy of it in a public repo is a different
# thing from publishing counts derived from it. The generated aggregate in
# src/lib/data/chronoSankey.ts IS committed, so the site builds from a clone;
# only regenerating needs the file. Delete this line to publish it.
data/chrono-sankey/reading-plan.tsv
